OriginOS kernel config
=====================
You do NOT maintain a full kernel config here — Debian's default is the
base, and config-fragment/origin.cfg holds ONLY your overrides.

Workflow (on a Debian build host with kernel source):
  1. Uncomment options in config-fragment/origin.cfg (one at a time).
  2. ./apply-fragment.sh /path/to/kernel-source
  3. Build/test the kernel the normal Debian way before it gets near an ISO.

Rule: if you can't explain what an option does, leave it commented.
